[{"title":"夜泊行台","author":"梁以壮","text":"为客无常宿，吾生百折肠。\n西风三面水，明月一船霜。\n戍影灯初灭，僮痴梦独长。\n几回蓬背立，浮世又他乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿店","author":"梁以壮","text":"亦有村醪在，疲颜饮不红。\n半生茅店外，万里画图中。\n白草今宵梦，黄尘明日风。\n话谁劳顿好，能得似田翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40925,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绥江泛月","author":"梁以壮","text":"秋宵不滞雨，随意放兰桡。\n寂寞清临水，空虚白到桥。\n三台无碍柳，孤阁有吹箫。\n寄语神仙女，潭烟莫浪飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40926,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仆去","author":"梁以壮","text":"仆去不复返，劳形不是孤。\n一身为半客，两手得双奴。\n检牍夜灯暗，思茶冷罐枯。\n平生笑婴母，红豆似珍珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40927,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登潭洲草阁","author":"梁以壮","text":"傍晚南风正，萧萧半似秋。\n山盘三面立，水抱四边流。\n斲石层云入，耕田小麦收。\n酒酣人独倚，清籁助长讴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40928,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都中将赴横水留别蔡朝干陈和宾","author":"梁以壮","text":"晨夕欣相好，王畿旅舍情。\n二年同一食，四月我先行。\n南顶谁重玩，东樵可再盟。\n独仍归未得，只是近羊城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40929,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隆中山访诸葛武侯旧迹","author":"梁以壮","text":"樵牧争相引，流泉古木馀。\n草庐终不出，天意复何如。\n人重西川朔，功高后汉书。\n南阳犹有地，谁更事耕锄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40930,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘上","author":"梁以壮","text":"天地不可测，阴晴变晓昏。\n何人在湘水，独自望秋原。\n萍实无因见，冤魂欲共论。\n度湾三十六，怀抱此时繁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40931,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游粤秀山各园亭","author":"梁以壮","text":"朝台久荒没，作景各为区。\n地主无南武，园亭有大夫。\n松涛惊耳湿，花气入胸腴。\n独怪峰峦在，依然古画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40932,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双阙","author":"梁以壮","text":"刘王宫尽毁，双阙尚巍峨。\n待漏何人肃，乘车此日过。\n物情新甲子，图画旧山河。\n形式盘龙虎，前潭有白鹅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40933,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊湖","author":"梁以壮","text":"菊湖今亦废，无复见黄华。\n零露馀秋草，荒塘落晚霞。\n香迷宫女旧，土蚀凤钗斜。\n亦有陶潜兴，还归处士家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40934,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集南园社谒三大忠","author":"梁以壮","text":"南园寻胜迹，良友一春同。\n风雅追前哲，人伦忆大忠。\n化鹃啼血热，沉海影厓空。\n有犹孤臣庙，为言宋未终。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40935,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妙高台谒苏文忠公遗像 其一","author":"梁以壮","text":"四面清临水，台幽古寺偏。\n大文昭日月，遗像肃山川。\n丹荔还堪食，青苗不易蠲。\n若非遭远谪，能得此閒缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40936,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妙高台谒苏文忠公遗像 其二","author":"梁以壮","text":"孤臣无定迹，时在画图中。\n一乞常州后，三移百粤东。\n微风吹玉带，馀韵起蚝桐。\n似解前生事，禅灯共影红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40937,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东皋","author":"梁以壮","text":"前朝名宦地，山水白烟中。\n逐鹿三更梦，扬尘一夜风。\n玉桥留照外，画阁入流东。\n我有先人宅，悠悠感慨同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40938,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过菂园谒黎忠悯公祠","author":"梁以壮","text":"板桥祠屋在，遗像肃斜矄。\n高咏摇南岳，孤忠冷画云。\n莲心如不散，兰影未曾分。\n次第看鸾鹤，清风远更闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40939,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花冢","author":"梁以壮","text":"万物皆有托，红颜独不齐。\n风流归冢在，生死是花迷。\n夜合朝吹尽，垂杨夕照低。\n不如痴妇嫁，享得世人妻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40940,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"掷砚亭怀抱真先生","author":"梁以壮","text":"奉贵且凌贱，趋闱亦近情。\n隶人严搜简，高士薄功名。\n道学归无欲，翎毛画又生。\n至今樵谷上，犹祭以兰蘅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40941,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流花桥","author":"梁以壮","text":"苑昨甘泉暮，山桥水四通。\n妆残梳更绿，花掷泛犹红。\n香雾迷楼阁，春心结螮蝀。\n六朝有脂粉，亦付一流中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40942,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大通寺晓望同李南强僧迹删","author":"梁以壮","text":"精神与天阔，磅礴一为探。\n昨夜蛟螭斗，寒烟不落潭。\n渡无羊跨五，笑有虎溪三。\n郁郁馀灵气，衣冠仍在南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40943,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩","author":"梁以壮","text":"石棱生万状，激水逆舟寒。\n不出千寻岭，那知十八滩。\n吾心殊弗险，世路未应难。\n瓠叶歌来者，秋风隔岸看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40944,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登吴城山亭望鄱阳湖","author":"梁以壮","text":"空阔一边白，秋光澹到天。\n数声传信雁，几点渡湖船。\n已久无龙斗，安知有蜃眠。\n登临非独我，怀抱独茫然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40945,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇纸","author":"梁以壮","text":"久在虚窗用，狂风亦独任。\n虽无百里命，真有托孤心。\n轻薄非所贵，方棱不易寻。\n洛阳抄赋后，珍重到于今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40946,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香篆","author":"梁以壮","text":"寂莫此天地，微微香篆通。\n尘空宵有月，窗静昼无风。\n万绪閒愁外，三年独坐中。\n成文看一线，飞去结鸿濛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40947,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花艇","author":"梁以壮","text":"花艇向城市，朝霞桨半函。\n孤兰犹在谷，众卉亦皆凡。\n易引群蜂昵，休招百舌谗。\n不知春渡后，还得似松杉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40948,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羽拂","author":"梁以壮","text":"尘埃连日夜，羽拂力还生。\n案上疑行雀，花边触落鹰。\n吾心非所用，世路亦何凭。\n童子持兹意，毋令污染憎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40949,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉轸","author":"梁以壮","text":"玉轸还堪用，冰弦讵易弹。\n疾徐吾自主，清浊汝为官。\n五岳空濛气，孤窗静昼寒。\n古音犹蕴蓄，不道转移难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40950,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过山龙","author":"梁以壮","text":"物微仍有思，导酒故成形。\n曲亦能为用，通因或偶醒。\n松花流欲赤，蛇腹染常青。\n我自瓮头去，春风笑尔停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40951,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剑","author":"梁以壮","text":"霜气凝书屋，芙容出水新。\n未尝鸣绮匣，先致有心人。\n白日摇风雨，空郊泣鬼神。\n文章不得力，瑶佩度阙津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40952,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盆柳","author":"梁以壮","text":"白玉围根小，空斋莫化蘋。\n前林有黄鸟，曾致一声春。\n影向偏于独，风吹不到邻。\n柴门犹未掩，应谢往来人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40953,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓梅","author":"梁以壮","text":"人老在天地，偏宜雅静中。\n心清存夜气，头白立晨风。\n澹素可能久，精神更不穷。\n襟期有如此，应与晓梅同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40954,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天露秭","author":"梁以壮","text":"秭实名嘉植，争传天露中。\n健脾扶力惫，安胃驻颜红。\n辟谷殊多事，烧丹亦太工。\n何如因地道，谁说养生穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40955,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蝶","author":"梁以壮","text":"飘然随所适，不必感行藏。\n舞袖华于婕，眠花姓是庄。\n阑干朝雨后，山径昼风长。\n莫与游蜂伍，纤毫毒易伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40956,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远堞","author":"梁以壮","text":"隐隐斜晖外，边关堞影高。\n帝王无万世，睥睨亦微劳。\n寒雾连沙漠，秋笳动海涛。\n城隅有战骨，容易守临洮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40957,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病马","author":"梁以壮","text":"伏枥日已久，桃花减却春。\n是谁能相尔，非老不骄人。\n梦入千军劲，心飞万里频。\n以兹劳在抱，愁似怯风尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40958,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柴门","author":"梁以壮","text":"几年爱幽僻，镇日掩柴门。\n落叶空惊犬，斜阳不入园。\n松风度山外，石藓上烟痕。\n却少人来往，桥边自一村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40959,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹门","author":"梁以壮","text":"月落无人叩，风过自有声。\n草虫连野阔，芦港近渔明。\n六逸还耽酒，五噫那入城。\n竹门惟重掩，留得一林清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40960,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹿角笔床","author":"梁以壮","text":"笔床一鹿角，閒亦与吾期。\n蕉梦三年冷，江花独卧知。\n可能触文思，休问逐争时。\n颇怪山中物，偏于风雅宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40961,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盆松","author":"梁以壮","text":"抑郁亦已久，涛声隐尺梢。\n无琴当寄韵，有鹤不能巢。\n薄养非求俭，孤情或见嘲。\n何须深壑上，始会化长蛟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40962,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海菭","author":"梁以壮","text":"青菭有馀绪，浮海独缠绵。\n日出能含影，龙归得抱涎。\n秪当生水国，不欲到人烟。\n若使克彝鼎，山珍无此鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40963,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛手柑","author":"梁以壮","text":"仙掌惊殊绝，黄柑似更奇。\n临风藏妙绝，掬指习禅仪。\n世事谁能计，人心汝若知。\n但逢荀奉倩，捉袖醒诗脾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40964,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春衣","author":"梁以壮","text":"春衣轻且适，閒更自生欢。\n谁拂青云去，吾思采蝶看。\n身随元气转，天与太和安。\n为践儿童约，临风水石端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40965,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纸衫","author":"梁以壮","text":"閒向空江上，秋云共一厓。\n人非贫故异，衫以纸为佳。\n白昼心如水，轻寒骨似柴。\n梅花时更好，明月照幽怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40966,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒲鞋","author":"梁以壮","text":"不必毁新角，犹存水气凉。\n十年尚閒散，安步亦疏狂。\n踏月黄添色，穿花暗惹香。\n似予情独癖，秋后未能忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40967,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋屐","author":"梁以壮","text":"两齿还无恙，登临一任将。\n每拖山岳雨，不践市廛霜。\n疏落神逾贵，安閒迹亦凉。\n丹枫看薄暮，车马竟何常。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40968,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗浮五色蝶","author":"梁以壮","text":"汝过百花径，奇香上画衣。\n文章妨物妒，富贵向春晖。\n亦带朝霞落，当随小凤归。\n精华有如此，閒梦莫相依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40969,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗浮五色雀","author":"梁以壮","text":"汝生尘俗外，小凤独名闻。\n身隐百花径，人知绝世文。\n若飞东海岛，恐化蓬莱云。\n物数如争校，高华影自分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40970,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸟中有白头翁者","author":"梁以壮","text":"自足高飞去，如霜发不簪。\n尔应羞对镜，谁可语知心。\n岂亦风尘老，还因寂寞深。\n病同人弃取，一定有微吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40971,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁影","author":"梁以壮","text":"一画云边小，雌雄尔自分。\n怨憎何所及，惊喜亦无闻。\n丛荻归曾早，微阳照欲曛。\n从来为客寄，留滞不如君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40972,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新菱","author":"梁以壮","text":"只在浮沉里，生来一自凉。\n味疑初食厚，角以渐看长。\n近似村多雨，才深水半塘。\n媚人红与绿，未得到岩廊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40973,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烟筒","author":"梁以壮","text":"岂尽投时好，烟筒亦所需。\n吹嘘全入世，持握半分奴。\n不律何轻重，为云在有无。\n平生一相见，惟尔易相娱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40974,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧柳","author":"梁以壮","text":"雨后危桥断，柔条掩半堤。\n阑干扶不住，春梦托黄鹂。\n岸口烟帷薄，湖边石枕低。\n灵和宫草没，愁拥小楼西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40975,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊栽","author":"梁以壮","text":"去秋开后落，微绿见新根。\n物类已如此，天心何用言。\n露深连夜润，雨细一春温。\n渐次能分种，江烟度柳轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40976,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱竹","author":"梁以壮","text":"最是罗浮竹，猗猗百尺殊。\n世人皆尚紫，而独好呈朱。\n似得南方正，何妨直到孤。\n名园争艳媚，衰落绛花趺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40977,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厨船","author":"梁以壮","text":"扁舟具一灶，便是野人居。\n傍岸还沽酒，中流不为鱼。\n乾坤随所适，身世未为虚。\n芦港炊烟入，斜阳半杂渔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40978,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归燕","author":"梁以壮","text":"垂柳湖堤尽，深宫汉已非。\n世人殊琐琐，而汝莫依依。\n能舞终衰宠，封王不易归。\n山林为得计，何独感秋晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40979,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石磬","author":"梁以壮","text":"峭亦无追琢，含情与玉同。\n泠然发幽响，如在空谷中。\n寒引青溪雨，禅生白昼风。\n不教门外听，秋叶一阶红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40980,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉瓶","author":"梁以壮","text":"瓦砾非所贵，无暇彻底澄。\n爱花添洁水，当座见良朋。\n气煖宜幽独，心虚入夜灯。\n在山犹自抱，器汝亦何凭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40981,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳烟","author":"梁以壮","text":"未许莺啼破，依微隔断虹。\n我心如郁结，何处有虚空。\n万里河桥外，三年客路中。\n不知隋昨日，春暗几离宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40982,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江云","author":"梁以壮","text":"空阔孤逾白，蓬莱隔几重。\n抱愁难化水，含雨不归龙。\n渡口立残月，天边作一峰。\n多情如有此，临镜惜秋容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40983,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹桥","author":"梁以壮","text":"野水断春路，竹桥斜处通。\n岸深前日雨，人怯一竿风。\n病后影同瘦，频来迹亦空。\n幽林正相引，长啸怀山翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40984,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山叟","author":"梁以壮","text":"谁复能拘束，闻骄耳便聋。\n懒因训鹿豕，老不见兵戎。\n度月吟梁父，眠云忆谢公。\n亦知人富贵，汉水乱流中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40985,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鼓角","author":"梁以壮","text":"鼓角防秋入，兼风起暮城。\n旧时严北戍，今日肃南征。\n近海沉云黑，通山落月清。\n故人昨投笔，骑马出西营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40986,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"并蒂菊","author":"梁以壮","text":"相爱在澹薄，兹情知者希。\n结将成晚节，交以共秋晖。\n狎昵人争尚，单寒世所讥。\n同心那可少，閒雅不相违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40987,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"并蒂莲","author":"梁以壮","text":"香艳双凝立，知为姊妹行。\n梦能通翡翠，魂欲化鸳鸯。\n含璧承珠露，同心在水乡。\n媚人如待嫁，肩右是娥皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40988,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨荷","author":"梁以壮","text":"荷池细雨乱，帘卷晚堂烟。\n香气不沉水，閒情欲放船。\n岸深风淅淅，龟冷叶田田。\n寂寞听馀韵，流声入槛边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40989,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山阁","author":"梁以壮","text":"尘机人不息，城郭日劳劳。\n空见侯门肃，那知山阁高。\n四时展图画，万物奏云璈。\n未敢骄王谢，乌衣半草蒿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40990,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山翁","author":"梁以壮","text":"礼数损真朴，佯狂不事文。\n薜衣青冉冉，鹤发白纷纷。\n心阔清似瀑，身閒高入云。\n有书藏石穴，还恐始皇焚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40991,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山札","author":"梁以壮","text":"一片能怀袖，三年又至今。\n岚开书鸟迹，谷冷吐兰心。\n月色照梁寂，松花落径深。\n拾遗无李渤，相约过幽林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40992,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山笛","author":"梁以壮","text":"虫响忽若失，鸣鸣四嶂开。\n冷云高不动，幽壑众相哀。\n往事隋宫柳，伤心汉苑梅。\n那知衰谢意，都在曲中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40993,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山径","author":"梁以壮","text":"数里通茅屋，松涛里面行。\n野花三月亚，水石一边明。\n载酒人来少，为吟独立清。\n近开兰菊坞，寂寞有谁争。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40994,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苔钱","author":"梁以壮","text":"苔钱因雨长，春富薄朱门。\n翠浅晨加色，园添夜见痕。\n岂能化蝴蝶，飞去恋花魂。\n自足娱幽寂，谁将势利论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40995,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]